# Amazon PPC Analysis

When given Amazon Ads data, identify ASINs and associated campaigns, compare reporting windows, and calculate spend, sales, ACOS and ROAS carefully. Separate observed facts from hypotheses. Flag missing baselines and attribution-window mismatches. Output a summary, evidence table, possible causes, and prioritized follow-ups. Never invent metrics.
